 f December\; three intake windows per year.\n\nOrganisation: MATS (ML Alig
 nment and Theory Scholars)\nLocation: In-person at MATS offices in Berkele
 y\, London\, or Washington DC\; visa support provided where required. For 
 experienced researchers with at least one substantial piece of research-ca
 liber work.\nAward: USD 155\,000 to 285\,000 per year gross (set by locati
 on\, seniority\, and experience)\, plus medical/dental/vision/life insuran
 ce\, retirement plan\, paid time off\, conference funding\, catered meals\
 , and up to USD 25\,000 relocation support. No application fee.\nDuration:
