 icymakers\, journalists and the public. PROFILE: hybrid technical and poli
 cy background\; technical fluency in AI evaluation\, hands-on policy or le
 gal experience related to AI\, academic research experience\, and strong c
 ommunication skills\; domain experience in mental health\, child safety\, 
 fraud\, political persuasion or consumer protection is a plus. Based in Sa
 n Francisco with in-person work expected\; visa sponsorship available. Rol
